 ̶e̶ ̶a̶ ̶L̶e̶i̶ ̶n̶.̶º̶ ̶6̶.̶4̶0̶4̶,̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶1̶5̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶d̶e̶z̶e̶m̶b̶r̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶1̶9̶7̶6̶,̶ ̶e̶ ̶d̶á̶ ̶o̶u̶t̶r̶a̶s̶ ̶p̶r̶o̶v̶i̶d̶ê̶n̶c̶i̶a̶s̶.̶","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-6","kind":"paragraph","tag":"p","text":"Exposição de motivos","html":"<u><a href=\"http://www.planalto.gov.br/CCIVIL_03/_Ato2019-2022/2020/Exm/Exm-MP-931-20.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Exposição de motivos</a></u>","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-7","kind":"paragraph","tag":"p","text":"Convertida na Lei n.º 14.030/2020","html":"<a href=\"lei14030.html\"><u><mark>Convertida na Lei n.º 14.030/2020</mark></u></a>","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-8","kind":"paragraph","tag":"p","text":"O̶ ̶P̶R̶E̶S̶I̶D̶E̶N̶T̶E̶ ̶D̶A̶ ̶R̶E̶P̶Ú̶B̶L̶I̶C̶A̶,̶ ̶n̶o̶ ̶u̶s̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶a̶t̶r̶i̶b̶u̶i̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶q̶u̶e̶ ̶l̶h̶e̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶f̶e̶r̶e̶ ̶o̶ ̶a̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶6̶2̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶C̶o̶n̶s̶t̶i̶t̶u̶i̶ç̶ã̶o̶,̶ ̶a̶d̶o̶t̶a̶ ̶a̶ ̶s̶e̶g̶u̶i̶n̶t̶e̶ ̶M̶e̶d̶i̶d̶a̶ ̶P̶r̶o̶v̶i̶s̶ó̶r̶i̶a̶,̶ ̶c̶o̶m̶ ̶f̶o̶r̶ç̶a̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶l̶e̶i̶:̶ ̶","html":"O̶ ̶P̶R̶E̶S̶I̶D̶E̶N̶T̶E̶ ̶D̶A̶ ̶R̶E̶P̶Ú̶B̶L̶I̶C̶A̶,̶ ̶n̶o̶ ̶u̶s̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶a̶t̶r̶i̶b̶u̶i̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶q̶u̶e̶ ̶l̶h̶e̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶f̶e̶r̶e̶ ̶o̶ ̶a̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶6̶2̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶C̶o̶n̶s̶t̶i̶t̶u̶i̶ç̶ã̶o̶,̶ ̶a̶d̶o̶t̶a̶ ̶a̶ ̶s̶e̶g̶u̶i̶n̶t̶e̶ ̶M̶e̶d̶i̶d̶a̶ ̶P̶r̶o̶v̶i̶s̶ó̶r̶i̶a̶,̶ ̶c̶o̶m̶ ̶f̶o̶r̶ç̶a̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶l̶e̶i̶:̶ ̶","article":"","paragraph":"","inciso":"","alinea":"","contextArticle":""},{"id":"b-9","kind":"paragraph","tag":"p","text":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶1̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶A̶ ̶s̶o̶c̶i̶e̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶a̶n̶ô̶n̶i̶m̶a̶ ̶c̶u̶j̶o̶ ̶e̶x̶e̶r̶c̶í̶c̶i̶o̶ ̶s̶o̶c̶i̶a̶l̶ ̶s̶e̶ ̶e̶n̶c̶e̶r̶r̶e̶ ̶e̶n̶t̶r̶e̶ ̶3̶1̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶d̶e̶z̶e̶m̶b̶r̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶2̶0̶1̶9̶ ̶e̶ ̶3̶1̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶m̶a̶r̶ç̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶2̶0̶2̶0̶ ̶p̶o̶d̶e̶r̶á̶,̶ ̶e̶x̶c̶e̶p̶c̶i̶o̶n̶a̶l̶m̶e̶n̶t̶e̶,̶ ̶r̶e̶a̶l̶i̶z̶a̶r̶ ̶a̶ ̶a̶s̶s̶e̶m̶b̶l̶e̶i̶a̶ ̶g̶e̶r̶a̶l̶ ̶o̶r̶d̶i̶n̶á̶r̶i̶a̶ ̶a̶ ̶q̶u̶e̶ ̶s̶e̶ ̶r̶e̶f̶e̶r̶e̶ ̶o̶ ̶a̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶1̶3̶2̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶L̶e̶i̶ ̶n̶.̶º̶ ̶6̶.̶4̶0̶4̶,̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶1̶5̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶d̶e̶z̶e̶m̶b̶r̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶1̶9̶7̶6̶,̶ ̶n̶o̶ ̶p̶r̶a̶z̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶0̶7̶ ̶(̶s̶e̶t̶e̶)̶ ̶m̶e̶s̶e̶s̶,̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶t̶a̶d̶o̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶t̶é̶r̶m̶i̶n̶o̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶ ̶e̶x̶e̶r̶c̶í̶c̶i̶o̶ ̶s̶o̶c̶i̶a̶l̶.̶ ̶§̶ ̶1̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶D̶i̶s̶p̶o̶s̶i̶ç̶õ̶e̶s̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶t̶r̶a̶t̶u̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶q̶u̶e̶ ̶e̶x̶i̶j̶a̶m̶ ̶a̶ ̶r̶e̶a̶l̶i̶z̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶a̶s̶s̶e̶m̶b̶l̶e̶i̶a̶ ̶g̶e̶r̶a̶l̶ ̶o̶r̶d̶i̶n̶á̶r̶i̶a̶ ̶e̶m̶ ̶p̶r̶a̶z̶o̶ ̶i̶n̶f̶e̶r̶i̶o̶r̶ ̶a̶o̶ ̶e̶s̶t̶a̶b̶e̶l̶e̶c̶i̶d̶o̶ ̶n̶o̶ ̶c̶a̶p̶u̶t̶ ̶s̶e̶r̶ã̶o̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶s̶i̶d̶e̶r̶a̶d̶a̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶m̶ ̶e̶f̶e̶i̶t̶o̶ ̶n̶o̶ ̶e̶x̶e̶r̶c̶í̶c̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶2̶0̶2̶0̶.̶ ̶§̶ ̶2̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶O̶s̶ ̶p̶r̶a̶z̶o̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶g̶e̶s̶t̶ã̶o̶ ̶o̶u̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶a̶t̶u̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶o̶s̶ ̶a̶d̶m̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶r̶a̶d̶o̶r̶e̶s̶,̶ ̶d̶o̶s̶ ̶m̶e̶m̶b̶r̶o̶s̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶s̶e̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶f̶i̶s̶c̶a̶l̶ ̶e̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶c̶o̶m̶i̶t̶ê̶s̶ ̶e̶s̶t̶a̶t̶u̶t̶á̶r̶i̶o̶s̶ ̶f̶i̶c̶a̶m̶ ̶p̶r̶o̶r̶r̶o̶g̶a̶d̶o̶s̶ ̶a̶t̶é̶ ̶a̶ ̶r̶e̶a̶l̶i̶z̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶a̶s̶s̶e̶m̶b̶l̶e̶i̶a̶ ̶g̶e̶r̶a̶l̶ ̶o̶r̶d̶i̶n̶á̶r̶i̶a̶ ̶n̶o̶s̶ ̶t̶e̶r̶m̶o̶s̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶d̶i̶s̶p̶o̶s̶t̶o̶ ̶n̶o̶ ̶c̶a̶p̶u̶t̶ ̶o̶u̶ ̶a̶t̶é̶ ̶q̶u̶e̶ ̶o̶c̶o̶r̶r̶a̶ ̶a̶ ̶r̶e̶u̶n̶i̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶s̶e̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶a̶d̶m̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶r̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶,̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶f̶o̶r̶m̶e̶ ̶o̶ ̶c̶a̶s̶o̶.̶ ̶§̶ ̶3̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶R̶e̶s̶s̶a̶l̶v̶a̶d̶a̶ ̶a̶ ̶h̶i̶p̶ó̶t̶e̶s̶e̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶p̶r̶e̶v̶i̶s̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶i̶v̶e̶r̶s̶a̶ ̶n̶o̶ ̶e̶s̶t̶a̶t̶u̶t̶o̶ ̶s̶o̶c̶i̶a̶l̶,̶ ̶c̶a̶b̶e̶r̶á̶ ̶a̶o̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶s̶e̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶a̶d̶m̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶r̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶l̶i̶b̶e̶r̶a̶r̶,̶ ̶a̶d̶ ̶r̶e̶f̶e̶r̶e̶n̶d̶u̶m̶,̶ ̶a̶s̶s̶u̶n̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶u̶r̶g̶e̶n̶t̶e̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶c̶o̶m̶p̶e̶t̶ê̶n̶c̶i̶a̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶a̶s̶s̶e̶m̶b̶l̶e̶i̶a̶ ̶g̶e̶r̶a̶l̶.̶ ̶§̶ ̶4̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶A̶p̶l̶i̶c̶a̶m̶-̶s̶e̶ ̶a̶s̶ ̶d̶i̶s̶p̶o̶s̶i̶ç̶õ̶e̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶s̶t̶e̶ ̶a̶r̶t̶i̶g̶o̶ ̶à̶s̶ ̶e̶m̶p̶r̶e̶s̶a̶s̶ ̶p̶ú̶b̶l̶i̶c̶a̶s̶,̶ ̶à̶s̶ ̶s̶o̶c̶i̶e̶d̶a̶d̶e̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶e̶c̶o̶n̶o̶m̶i̶a̶ ̶m̶i̶s̶t̶a̶ ̶e̶ ̶à̶s̶ ̶s̶u̶b̶s̶i̶d̶i̶á̶r̶i̶a̶s̶ ̶d̶a̶s̶ ̶r̶e̶f̶e̶r̶i̶d̶a̶s̶ ̶e̶m̶p̶r̶e̶s̶a̶s̶ ̶e̶ ̶s̶o̶c̶i̶e̶d̶a̶d̶e̶s̶.̶ ̶","html":"A̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶1̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶A̶ ̶s̶o̶c̶i̶e̶d̶a̶d̶e̶ ̶a̶n̶ô̶n̶i̶m̶a̶ ̶c̶u̶j̶o̶ ̶e̶x̶e̶r̶c̶í̶c̶i̶o̶ ̶s̶o̶c̶i̶a̶l̶ ̶s̶e̶ ̶e̶n̶c̶e̶r̶r̶e̶ ̶e̶n̶t̶r̶e̶ ̶3̶1̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶d̶e̶z̶e̶m̶b̶r̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶2̶0̶1̶9̶ ̶e̶ ̶3̶1̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶m̶a̶r̶ç̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶2̶0̶2̶0̶ ̶p̶o̶d̶e̶r̶á̶,̶ ̶e̶x̶c̶e̶p̶c̶i̶o̶n̶a̶l̶m̶e̶n̶t̶e̶,̶ ̶r̶e̶a̶l̶i̶z̶a̶r̶ ̶a̶ ̶a̶s̶s̶e̶m̶b̶l̶e̶i̶a̶ ̶g̶e̶r̶a̶l̶ ̶o̶r̶d̶i̶n̶á̶r̶i̶a̶ ̶a̶ ̶q̶u̶e̶ ̶s̶e̶ ̶r̶e̶f̶e̶r̶e̶ ̶o̶ ̶a̶r̶t̶.̶ ̶1̶3̶2̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶L̶e̶i̶ ̶n̶.̶º̶ ̶6̶.̶4̶0̶4̶,̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶1̶5̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶d̶e̶z̶e̶m̶b̶r̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶1̶9̶7̶6̶,̶ ̶n̶o̶ ̶p̶r̶a̶z̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶0̶7̶ ̶(̶s̶e̶t̶e̶)̶ ̶m̶e̶s̶e̶s̶,̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶t̶a̶d̶o̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶t̶é̶r̶m̶i̶n̶o̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶s̶e̶u̶ ̶e̶x̶e̶r̶c̶í̶c̶i̶o̶ ̶s̶o̶c̶i̶a̶l̶.̶<br>\n̶§̶ ̶1̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶D̶i̶s̶p̶o̶s̶i̶ç̶õ̶e̶s̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶t̶r̶a̶t̶u̶a̶i̶s̶ ̶q̶u̶e̶ ̶e̶x̶i̶j̶a̶m̶ ̶a̶ ̶r̶e̶a̶l̶i̶z̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶a̶s̶s̶e̶m̶b̶l̶e̶i̶a̶ ̶g̶e̶r̶a̶l̶ ̶o̶r̶d̶i̶n̶á̶r̶i̶a̶ ̶e̶m̶ ̶p̶r̶a̶z̶o̶ ̶i̶n̶f̶e̶r̶i̶o̶r̶ ̶a̶o̶ ̶e̶s̶t̶a̶b̶e̶l̶e̶c̶i̶d̶o̶ ̶n̶o̶ ̶c̶a̶p̶u̶t̶ ̶s̶e̶r̶ã̶o̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶s̶i̶d̶e̶r̶a̶d̶a̶s̶ ̶s̶e̶m̶ ̶e̶f̶e̶i̶t̶o̶ ̶n̶o̶ ̶e̶x̶e̶r̶c̶í̶c̶i̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶2̶0̶2̶0̶.̶<br>\n̶§̶ ̶2̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶O̶s̶ ̶p̶r̶a̶z̶o̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶g̶e̶s̶t̶ã̶o̶ ̶o̶u̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶a̶t̶u̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶o̶s̶ ̶a̶d̶m̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶r̶a̶d̶o̶r̶e̶s̶,̶ ̶d̶o̶s̶ ̶m̶e̶m̶b̶r̶o̶s̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶s̶e̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶f̶i̶s̶c̶a̶l̶ ̶e̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶c̶o̶m̶i̶t̶ê̶s̶ ̶e̶s̶t̶a̶t̶u̶t̶á̶r̶i̶o̶s̶ ̶f̶i̶c̶a̶m̶ ̶p̶r̶o̶r̶r̶o̶g̶a̶d̶o̶s̶ ̶a̶t̶é̶ ̶a̶ ̶r̶e̶a̶l̶i̶z̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶a̶s̶s̶e̶m̶b̶l̶e̶i̶a̶ ̶g̶e̶r̶a̶l̶ ̶o̶r̶d̶i̶n̶á̶r̶i̶a̶ ̶n̶o̶s̶ ̶t̶e̶r̶m̶o̶s̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶d̶i̶s̶p̶o̶s̶t̶o̶ ̶n̶o̶ ̶c̶a̶p̶u̶t̶ ̶o̶u̶ ̶a̶t̶é̶ ̶q̶u̶e̶ ̶o̶c̶o̶r̶r̶a̶ ̶a̶ ̶r̶e̶u̶n̶i̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶o̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶s̶e̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶a̶d̶m̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶r̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶,̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶f̶o̶r̶m̶e̶ ̶o̶ ̶c̶a̶s̶o̶.̶<br>\n̶§̶ ̶3̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶R̶e̶s̶s̶a̶l̶v̶a̶d̶a̶ ̶a̶ ̶h̶i̶p̶ó̶t̶e̶s̶e̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶p̶r̶e̶v̶i̶s̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶i̶v̶e̶r̶s̶a̶ ̶n̶o̶ ̶e̶s̶t̶a̶t̶u̶t̶o̶ ̶s̶o̶c̶i̶a̶l̶,̶ ̶c̶a̶b̶e̶r̶á̶ ̶a̶o̶ ̶c̶o̶n̶s̶e̶l̶h̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶a̶d̶m̶i̶n̶i̶s̶t̶r̶a̶ç̶ã̶o̶ ̶d̶e̶l̶i̶b̶e̶r̶a̶r̶,̶ ̶a̶d̶ ̶r̶e̶f̶e̶r̶e̶n̶d̶u̶m̶,̶ ̶a̶s̶s̶u̶n̶t̶o̶s̶ ̶u̶r̶g̶e̶n̶t̶e̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶c̶o̶m̶p̶e̶t̶ê̶n̶c̶i̶a̶ ̶d̶a̶ ̶a̶s̶s̶e̶m̶b̶l̶e̶i̶a̶ ̶g̶e̶r̶a̶l̶.̶<br>\n̶§̶ ̶4̶.̶º̶ ̶ ̶A̶p̶l̶i̶c̶a̶m̶-̶s̶e̶ ̶a̶s̶ ̶d̶i̶s̶p̶o̶s̶i̶ç̶õ̶e̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶s̶t̶e̶ ̶a̶r̶t̶i̶g̶o̶ ̶à̶s̶ ̶e̶m̶p̶r̶e̶s̶a̶s̶ ̶p̶ú̶b̶l̶i̶c̶a̶s̶,̶ ̶à̶s̶ ̶s̶o̶c̶i̶e̶d̶a̶d̶e̶s̶ ̶d̶e̶ ̶e̶c̶o̶n̶o̶m̶i̶a̶ ̶m̶i